WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Importing is only the first step
Automatic mapping is a starting point. Check each column’s values and units in the data preview.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Match source columns to analysis fields
Choose the meaning of each column in mapping settings. Cost is not clicks; installs are not signups.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Resolve missing or duplicate fields
Fix missing required fields or conflicting mappings. Do not invent zeros for data you do not have.

4
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Analyze again after changes
Run analysis again after changing mappings. If data is still insufficient, supply the required columns, rows or periods first.
